                <pb facs="0230" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3731/906: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-08-15">August 15, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 393, August 15, 9 a.m. Department concurs in your opinion that immediate
                    reduction of consular fee advisable and believes it should be insisted upon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
